Error: Jet.UnusedPlaceMark: `^` marks a named value, and this argument isn't one
  --> Tests/UI/e0225_call_mark_fresh_value.jet:4:17
    |
  4 |     print(count(^[Int]{1, 2}))
    |                 ^
 Why: `count: fn(items: [Int])` reads this input; a call mark applies only to a named argument the call changes or takes
 Fix: Remove the `^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnusedPlaceMark
